      "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:14:43.514705+00:00",
      "content": "`Spec.predict_in_range_spec`\n\nFor every `a < 113` and `b < 113`, `predict(a, b)` does not panic and, if it returns, returns `Some((a + b) % 113)`. Premise: the `static` weight tables of `src/weights.rs` hold their compiled contents (`weightsStored`).",
