      "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:14:43.657855+00:00",
      "content": "`Spec.predict_out_of_range_spec`\n\nFor every `usize` pair with `a >= 113` or `b >= 113`, `predict(a, b)` does not panic and, if it returns, returns `None`. Premise: the `static` weight tables hold their compiled contents (`weightsStored`).",
