      "event_type": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:14:43.881880+00:00",
      "content": "`Spec.predict_no_panic_spec`\n\nFor every pair of `usize` values `a`, `b`, `predict(a, b)` never panics: no out-of-bounds index, division by zero, arithmetic overflow, or other undefined behaviour occurs, and any return is a normal return. Premise: the `static` weight tables hold their compiled contents (`weightsStored`).",
