      "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:14:59.788394+00:00",
      "content": "`Spec.weightsStored`\n\nThe premise of the three `predict` properties: the 15 `static` weight tables of `src/weights.rs` (`TOK`, `POS`, `WQ`, `WK`, `WV`, `WO`, `WIN`, `BIN`, `WOUT`, `BOUT`, `U`, `EXP_N`, `EXP_2`, `EXP_1`, `EXP_0`) hold exactly their source entries in row-major order: each `i8` is stored as one byte and each `i64` as eight little-endian bytes.",
